    <panel_attributes>Additional constraints
--
- Project can not be published 
unless they have at least one Invention.
- The effort of a project must be computed in PMs 
(“person-months”) as the sum of active months of its components divided by 
the number of people involved.”
- closeOut must be After kickOff.
- minEffort, maxEffort, averageEffort are operations about the effort 
related to all user's projects .
- deviationProject is the average of  totalProjects  of other Managers 
minus user totalProjects
- deviationEffort is the averageEffort of others managers 
minus user's projects average effort.
- totalProjects is the count of user's projects.
bg=RED
</panel_attributes>
